[% /* Generates the runbook incident response artifact. */ %]# Incident Response Runbook

## Generated Checklist

1. Identify the impacted deployment unit and stage from `infrastructure/samconfig.toml`.
2. Check CloudWatch logs, metrics, alarms, and dashboards modeled in `infrastructure/units/<deployment-unit>/template.yaml`.
3. Confirm whether any manual actions in `generated/reports/manual-actions.md` were unresolved.
4. If deployment-related, follow `docs/runbooks/rollback.md`.

